---
const pillars = [
  { title: "Three Generations", desc: "The trade runs in the family, passed from father and grandfather to the next generation." },
  { title: "Hands-on Team", desc: "From planning through the final walkthrough, our team stays close to the work." },
  { title: "Masonry & Concrete", desc: "Walls, stonework, patios and flatwork: two trades with one clear focus on the finish." },
  { title: "Working Together", desc: "We talk through the plan, the budget and the details that matter to your project." }
];
---

<section class="section section--dark family-story" id="our-story" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
  <div class="container stack stack--2xl">
    <div class="story-layout">
      <figure class="founders-photo stack stack--md">
        <img
          src="/images/story/jose-marlin-ruiz-legacy.jpg"
          alt="Two people standing outdoors; identities pending confirmation"
          width="700" height="933" loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>

      <div class="story-copy stack stack--xl">
        <h2 id="why-heading" class="story-heading">
          The Trade Runs Deep.<br />
          <span>So Does the Work.</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="story-intro stack stack--md">
          <p>This work was learned shoulder to shoulder with a father, grandfather and uncles. Three generations later, masonry and concrete are still a family trade.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-body stack stack--md">
          <p>From a smaller improvement to a custom home or commercial build, we bring that experience to the details people see and use every day.</p>
          <p>Good work gives the next generation something to build on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-principles grid-2">
      {pillars.map((pillar) => (
        <article class="principle stack stack--sm">
          <h3>{pillar.title}</h3>
          <p>{pillar.desc}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <figure class="crew-note">
      <img
        src="/images/story/ruiz-crew-on-site.jpg"
        alt="People working on concrete; project provenance pending verification"
        width="700" height="704" loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption class="stack stack--md">
        <p class="crew-description">The finished surface gets the attention. The work behind it is what makes the difference.</p>
        <div class="stack stack--xs">
          <span class="photo-name">On the Jobsite</span>
          <span class="photo-caption">From preparation to the finish</span>
        </div>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .family-story {
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .story-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: var(--space-16);
  }

  .founders-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .photo-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .photo-caption {
    color: var(--text-light-muted);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .story-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .story-heading span {
    color: var(--ruiz-sandstone-light);
  }

  .story-intro > p:last-child {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.5vw, 1.375rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .placeholder-label {
    color: var(--ruiz-sandstone-light);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .story-body {
    color: var(--text-light-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .story-principles {
    column-gap: var(--space-16);
    row-gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .principle {
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--border-dark-strong);
    padding-block-start: var(--space-6);
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .principle p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-light-muted);
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .crew-note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-card-p);
    background: var(--bg-dark-elevated);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .crew-note img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .crew-description {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.625rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 959px) {
    .story-layout {
      gap: var(--space-8);
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 699px) {
    .story-layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .founders-photo img {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      object-position: center 38%;
    }

    .story-principles,
    .crew-note {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
